y) across the same seed set, the synthesis is invalidated and the engine\u2019s claimed edge is deemed an artifact of the simulation.", "models": ["cerebras:zai-glm-4.7", "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free", "openai/gpt-oss-120b:free", "cerebras:gpt-oss-120b", "openai/gpt-oss-20b:free"]}, "disclosure": "Perturbed/synthetic bars -> BS-sim option fills -> RANKING-ONLY, not a WR authority (CLAUDE.md C1)."}
